🚀 Project Overview

This project is an AI Customer Support Agent designed to assist customers of a beverage brand (Kokum Soft Drinks).
The agent can respond to customer questions related to products, availability, pricing, orders, and general brand information — reducing manual support effort.

Built using Jotform AI tools, this project demonstrates how AI can be quickly deployed to solve real-world business problems without a traditional backend.

✨ Key Features

🤖 AI-Powered Customer Support Agent

💬 Natural language conversation

🛍️ Answers product-related queries (flavors, availability, etc.)

📦 Handles basic order & support questions

⚡ Instant automated responses

🌐 Web-embeddable chatbot

🧩 No-code / low-code implementation

🎯 Designed for small-to-medium businesses

🛠️ Tech Stack

Jotform AI Agent

Jotform Forms & Logic

Web-based chatbot interface

AI-driven intent handling

Note: This project focuses on AI integration and product thinking, not backend development.

